  "instructions": [
    "Heat sesame oil in the bamboo steamer over medium heat.",
    "Add grated ginger and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add minced garlic and cook for another minute.",
    "Add sliced mushrooms and cook until they release their moisture.",
    "In a separate pan, mix yeast, flour, and vegetable broth to create a light yeasty sauce.",
    "Bring the sauce to a simmer and cook for 2 minutes.",
    "Add the sauce to the bamboo steamer and stir to combine.",
    "Season with salt and black pepper to taste.",
    "Serve the mushrooms in the bamboo steamer garnished with chopped fresh parsley.",
    "Serve hot and enjoy!"
